@startuml
' NewEra POS - Use case diagram (overview), W08 update: Store manager added as secondary actor (review #50, B-D11)
' Team D - editable source of assets/use_case_diagram.png
' Render with: java -jar plantuml.jar -tpng assets/use_case_diagram.puml
' Note: the position of the use cases is decided by the automatic layout; the
' Store manager is connected to UC1 (price override), UC2 (cash refund approval), UC4 (review of a session, W09) and UC5 (damage and cash refund, W09), where exceptions are approved.
' W08: UC2 no longer uses the Tax Calculator (review #37): the refund is the price paid plus the tax charged in the sale.

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ActorBorderColor #444444
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam UsecaseBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam UsecaseBackgroundColor #EAF1FB
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam RectangleBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 120

title NewEra POS - Use case diagram

actor "Cashier" as Cashier
actor "Store manager\n<<secondary user>>" as Manager

rectangle "NewEra POS" {
  usecase "UC1\nProcess Sale" as UC1
  usecase "UC2\nHandle Returns" as UC2
  usecase "UC3\nProcess Rental" as UC3
  usecase "UC5\nReturn Rental" as UC5
  usecase "UC4\nStart Up" as UC4
}

actor "Payment Service\n<<external system>>" as Payment
actor "Tax Calculator\n<<external system>>" as Tax
actor "Accounting System\n<<external system>>" as Accounting
actor "HR System\n<<external system>>" as HR

' Primary actor
Cashier -- UC1
Cashier -- UC2
Cashier -- UC3
Cashier -- UC5
Cashier -- UC4

' Secondary user: approves exceptions (price override and reorder list in UC1,
' refund exceptions in UC2, damage of a rented item in UC5)
Manager -- UC1
Manager -- UC2
Manager -- UC4
Manager -- UC5

' Supporting actors (external systems)
UC1 -- Payment
UC2 -- Payment
UC3 -- Payment
UC5 -- Payment

UC1 -- Tax
UC3 -- Tax
UC5 -- Tax

UC1 -- Accounting
UC2 -- Accounting
UC3 -- Accounting
UC5 -- Accounting
UC4 -- Accounting

UC4 -- HR

legend bottom
  Primary actor (left): Cashier.  Secondary user (left): Store manager, who approves price overrides (UC1), cash refunds (UC2, UC5) and damages (UC5), and reviews sessions (UC4).
  Supporting actors (right): the 4 external systems.
  The Customer is a stakeholder, not an actor: he/she acts only through the Cashier.
endlegend
@enduml
